@rikba The dynamic range in raw Hypersim images is huge, just like dynamic range of real images from a real camera. It is not useful to map the min and max values in each image linearly to the range [0,1], which is what cv2.normalize(...) is doing. Instead, you need to apply a tone-mapping algorithm to compress the huge dynamic range in these images in a meaningful way.

